        lsfo_page_desc: "Low-sulfur fuel oil is an environmentally friendly marine fuel that complies with international IMO 2020 standards. The use of this type of fuel significantly reduces sulfur oxide emissions, which helps protect the marine ecosystem and improve air quality.",
        petcoke_page_desc: "Petroleum coke (Petcoke) is a carbon-rich solid material derived from oil refining. It is used in the manufacture of electrodes and as a fuel.",
        diesel_page_desc: "Hydrotreated diesel fuel is a high-quality fuel with minimum sulfur content. The hydrotreating process significantly reduces harmful emissions during combustion, making this fuel environmentally efficient and compliant with modern global standards.",
